180
00:13:26,844 --> 00:13:31,491
Before any command, write four mechanisms
that could produce the symptom and the

181
00:13:31,531 --> 00:13:36,237
local command that tests each. Before the
rebuild, write the two arguments of git

182
00:13:36,277 --> 00:13:40,865
rebase --onto you'll use and what each
